#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/openstack/docker.rst:2
msgid "Docker"
msgstr "Docker"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/openstack/docker.rst:4
msgid ""
"So far this document has covered how to add the Openstack cloud integration "
"and has described how to provision virtual machine-based Instances via the "
"`Add Instance` catalog in `Provisioning`. Another great feature provided by "
"|morpheus| out of the box is the ability to work with Docker containers and "
"even support multiple containers per Docker host. To do this, a Docker host "
"must first be provisioned into Openstack (multiple hosts are needed when "
"dealing with horizontal scaling scenarios)."
msgstr ""
"So far este document tiene covered how to add el Openstack cloud integration"
" y tiene described how to provision virtual machine-based Instances via el "
"`Add Instance` catalog in `Provisioning`. Another great característica "
"provided by |morpheus| out of el box es el ability to work con Docker "
"containers y incluso support múltiples containers per Docker host. To do "
"este, un Docker host debe primero be provisioned en Openstack (múltiples "
"hosts son needed cuando dealing con horizontal scaling scenarios)."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/openstack/docker.rst:6
msgid ""
"To provision a Docker Host, navigate to Infrastructure > Clusters and click "
":guilabel:`+ ADD CLUSTER`. Complete the provisioning wizard including "
"selecting the appropriate Group and Cloud. Alternatively, you can navigate "
"to the Clusters tab for a specific Cloud (Infrastructure > Clouds > Specific"
" Cloud detail page > Clusters tab) and begin the process of provisioning a "
"Docker host to that Cloud from there. Once completed, this host will show up"
" in the Hosts sections (Infrastructure > Hosts OR Infrastructure > Clouds > "
"Specific Cloud detail page > Hosts tab). |morpheus| views a Docker host just"
" like any other Hypervisor with the caveat being that it is used for running"
" containerized images instead of virtualized ones."
msgstr ""
"To provision un Docker Host, navigate to Infrastructure > Clusters y click "
":guilabel:`+ AGREGAR CLUSTER`. Complete el provisioning wizard including "
"selecting el apropiado Group y Cloud. Alternatively, you puede navigate to "
"el Clusters pestaña para un específico Cloud (Infrastructure > Clouds > "
"Specific Cloud página de detalles > Clusters pestaña) y begin el proceso of "
"provisioning un Docker host to que Cloud desde allí. Una vez completadod, "
"este host será show up in el Hosts sections (Infrastructure > Hosts OR "
"Infrastructure > Clouds > Specific Cloud página de detalles > Hosts "
"pestaña). |morpheus| views un Docker host solo like cualquier otro "
"Hypervisor con el caveat being que it se utiliza para running containerized "
"images en cambio of virtualized ones."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/openstack/docker.rst:8
msgid ""
"Once a Docker Host is successfully provisioned, a green checkmark will "
"appear to the right of the host marking it as available for use. In the "
"event of a failure, click into the relevant host that failed and an error "
"explaining the failure will be displayed in red at the top."
msgstr ""
"Once un Docker Host es successfully provisioned, un green checkmark será "
"appear to el right of el host marking it as disponible para use. En el "
"evento of un failure, click en el relevante host que fallido y un error "
"explaining el failure se mostrará in red en la parte superior."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/openstack/docker.rst:10
msgid ""
"Some common error scenarios include network connectivity. For a Docker Host "
"to function properly, it must be able to resolve the |morpheus| appliance "
"URL which can be configured in |AdmSet|. If it is unable to resolve and "
"negotiate with the appliance, the |morpheus| Agent installation will fail "
"and provisioning instructions will not be able to be issued to the host."
msgstr ""
"Some common error scenarios include network connectivity. For un Docker Host"
" to función properly, it debe be able to resolve el |morpheus| appliance URL"
" cual se puede configurar in |AdmSet|. If it es unable to resolve y "
"negotiate con el appliance, el |morpheus| Agent instalación será fail y "
"provisioning instructions no be able to be issued to el host."
